arguments.prompt:
You are implementing a Blazor Web App for a logistics company that tracks shipments. The project has already been scaffolded at `/tmp/sv-8d6ba0f98188498c8586a14f96a17ab1/ShipmentTracker/` using `dotnet new blazor -int Auto -ai -au Individual`.

The project structure:
- `ShipmentTracker/` - Server project
- `ShipmentTracker.Client/` - Client (WebAssembly) project

Key facts about this Auto + Global mode setup:
- All interactive components MUST live in the `.Client` project
- Interactive components cannot access DbContext directly - must use HTTP APIs
- Define service interfaces in `.Client`, implement with HttpClient there, and implement with direct DB access in server
- Both Program.cs files register matching services
- No need to add `@rendermode` to pages (global mode)

## Tasks

### 1. Create shared models

Create `/tmp/sv-8d6ba0f98188498c8586a14f96a17ab1/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Models/Shipment.cs`:

```csharp
namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

public class Shipment
{
    public int Id { get; set; }
    public string TrackingNumber { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Origin { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Destination { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public ShipmentStatus Status { get; set; }
    public DateTime ShippedDate { get; set; }
    public DateTime EstimatedDelivery { get; set; }
    public string CustomerEmail { get; set; } = string.Empty;
    public string Description { get; set; } = string.Empty;
}

public enum ShipmentStatus
{
    Pending,
    PickedUp,
    InTransit,
    OutForDelivery,
    Delivered,
    Exception
}
```

### 2. Create IShipmentService interface

Create `/tmp/sv-8d6ba0f98188498c8586a14f96a17ab1/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/IShipmentService.cs`:

```csharp
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public interface IShipmentService
{
    Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync();
    Task<Shipment?> GetByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber);
    Task UpdateStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus);
}
```

### 3. Create HttpClient-based implementation in Client project

Create `/tmp/sv-8d6ba0f98188498c8586a14f96a17ab1/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Services/ShipmentServiceClient.cs`:

```csharp
using System.Net.Http.Json;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

public class ShipmentServiceClient(HttpClient http) : IShipmentService
{
    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        return await http.GetFromJsonAsync<List<Shipment>>("api/shipments") ?? [];
    }

    public async Task<Shipment?> GetByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        return await http.GetFromJsonAsync<Shipment?>($"api/shipments/track/{trackingNumber}");
    }

    public async Task UpdateStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus)
    {
        await http.PutAsJsonAsync($"api/shipments/{id}/status", newStatus);
    }
}
```

### 4. Create server-side implementation

Create `/tmp/sv-8d6ba0f98188498c8586a14f96a17ab1/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Services/ShipmentService.cs`:

```csharp
using Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;
using ShipmentTracker.Data;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Services;

public class ShipmentService(ApplicationDbContext db) : IShipmentService
{
    public async Task<List<Shipment>> GetAllShipmentsAsync()
    {
        return await db.Shipments.OrderByDescending(s => s.ShippedDate).ToListAsync();
    }

    public async Task<Shipment?> GetByTrackingNumberAsync(string trackingNumber)
    {
        return await db.Shipments.FirstOrDefaultAsync(s => s.TrackingNumber == trackingNumber);
    }

    public async Task UpdateStatusAsync(int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus)
    {
        var shipment = await db.Shipments.FindAsync(id);
        if (shipment is not null)
        {
            shipment.Status = newStatus;
            await db.SaveChangesAsync();
        }
    }
}
```

### 5. Update ApplicationDbContext

Edit `/tmp/sv-8d6ba0f98188498c8586a14f96a17ab1/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Data/ApplicationDbContext.cs` to add:

```csharp
using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Identity.EntityFrameworkCore;
using Microsoft.EntityFrameworkCore;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Data;

public class ApplicationDbContext(DbContextOptions<ApplicationDbContext> options) : IdentityDbContext<ApplicationUser>(options)
{
    public DbSet<Shipment> Shipments => Set<Shipment>();
}
```

### 6. Create API endpoints

Create `/tmp/sv-8d6ba0f98188498c8586a14f96a17ab1/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker/Endpoints/ShipmentEndpoints.cs`:

```csharp
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models;
using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services;

namespace ShipmentTracker.Endpoints;

public static class ShipmentEndpoints
{
    public static void MapShipmentEndpoints(this WebApplication app)
    {
        var group = app.MapGroup("api/shipments").RequireAuthorization();

        group.MapGet("", async (IShipmentService service) =>
            await service.GetAllShipmentsAsync());

        group.MapGet("track/{trackingNumber}", async (string trackingNumber, IShipmentService service) =>
        {
            var shipment = await service.GetByTrackingNumberAsync(trackingNumber);
            return shipment is not null ? Results.Ok(shipment) : Results.NotFound();
        }).AllowAnonymous();

        group.MapPut("{id}/status", async (int id, ShipmentStatus newStatus, IShipmentService service) =>
        {
            await service.UpdateStatusAsync(id, newStatus);
            return Results.NoContent();
        });
    }
}
```

Note: The tracking endpoint is AllowAnonymous so customers can track without logging in. The list and update endpoints require auth (for dispatchers).

### 7. Create Dispatcher page

Create `/tmp/sv-8d6ba0f98188498c8586a14f96a17ab1/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Pages/Dispatch.razor`:

```razor
@page "/dispatch"
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Authorization
@using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models
@using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services
@attribute [Authorize]
@inject IShipmentService ShipmentService

<PageTitle>Dispatch Dashboard</PageTitle>

<h1>Shipment Dispatch</h1>

@if (shipments is null)
{
    <p><em>Loading shipments...</em></p>
}
else
{
    <div class="mb-3">
        <input type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="Filter by destination..."
               @bind="filterText" @bind:event="oninput" />
    </div>

    <table class="table table-striped">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Tracking #</th>
                <th>Origin</th>
                <th>Destination</th>
                <th>Status</th>
                <th>Shipped</th>
                <th>ETA</th>
                <th>Action</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            @foreach (var shipment in FilteredShipments)
            {
                <tr>
                    <td>@shipment.TrackingNumber</td>
                    <td>@shipment.Origin</td>
                    <td>@shipment.Destination</td>
                    <td><span class="badge @GetStatusBadgeClass(shipment.Status)">@shipment.Status</span></td>
                    <td>@shipment.ShippedDate.ToShortDateString()</td>
                    <td>@shipment.EstimatedDelivery.ToShortDateString()</td>
                    <td>
                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm" value="@shipment.Status"
                                @onchange="e => UpdateStatus(shipment, e)">
                            @foreach (var status in Enum.GetValues<ShipmentStatus>())
                            {
                                <option value="@status">@status</option>
                            }
                        </select>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            }
        </tbody>
    </table>
}

@code {
    private List<Shipment>? shipments;
    private string filterText = string.Empty;

    private IEnumerable<Shipment> FilteredShipments =>
        shipments?.Where(s => string.IsNullOrEmpty(filterText)
            || s.Destination.Contains(filterText, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)) ?? [];

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        shipments = await ShipmentService.GetAllShipmentsAsync();
    }

    private async Task UpdateStatus(Shipment shipment, ChangeEventArgs e)
    {
        if (Enum.TryParse<ShipmentStatus>(e.Value?.ToString(), out var newStatus))
        {
            await ShipmentService.UpdateStatusAsync(shipment.Id, newStatus);
            shipment.Status = newStatus;
        }
    }

    private static string GetStatusBadgeClass(ShipmentStatus status) => status switch
    {
        ShipmentStatus.Delivered => "bg-success",
        ShipmentStatus.InTransit => "bg-primary",
        ShipmentStatus.OutForDelivery => "bg-info",
        ShipmentStatus.Exception => "bg-danger",
        ShipmentStatus.PickedUp => "bg-warning text-dark",
        _ => "bg-secondary"
    };
}
```

### 8. Create Customer Tracking page

Create `/tmp/sv-8d6ba0f98188498c8586a14f96a17ab1/ShipmentTracker/ShipmentTracker.Client/Pages/Track.razor`:

```razor
@page "/track"
@page "/track/{TrackingNumber}"
@using ShipmentTracker.Client.Models
@using ShipmentTracker.Client.Services
@inject IShipmentService ShipmentService

<PageTitle>Track Shipment</PageTitle>

<h1>Track Your Shipment</h1>

<div class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="input-group">
            <input type="text" class="form-control" placeholder="Enter tracking number..."
                   @bind="searchTrackingNumber" @bind:event="oninput"
                   @onkeydown="HandleKeyDown" />
            <button class="btn btn-primary" @onclick="SearchShipment">
                Track
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@if (isLoading)
{
    <p><em>Searching...</em></p>
}
else if (notFound)
{
    <div class="alert alert-warning">
        No shipment found with tracking number "<strong>@searchedNumber</strong>".
    </div>
}
else if (shipment is not null)
{
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
            <h5 class="mb-0">Shipment @shipment.TrackingNumber</h5>
        </div>
        <div class="card-body">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-md-6">
